{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-7","storyName":"“血钻”的歌声","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拍摄地块在源石风暴中遭到损毁，蒂比震惊于真凶竟是好友的事实，决意拯救地块。与此同时，卢西恩再次找到已经陷入癫狂的莫伊拉。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["愤怒的工作人员","害怕的工作人员","无线电中的声音","摄影助理","米兰妮","蒂比","莫伊拉","卢西恩"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_wind","layer":"1","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind_howling","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_bg_62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$jealous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_jealous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":12,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"这就是*蓝卡坞片场术语*格蕾塔的拍摄计划？！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"都贴在源石风暴脸上了！摆明让我们送死啊！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"不......不......一定是凶手干的！你没听到之前的爆炸声吗？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"地块的驾驶室被人为炸毁了......我们现在根本没办法改变地块的移动速度和航向......","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"现在地块接触的还只是天灾的最外围，真等我们撞向它的正中心......","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"整个地块估计连一块完整的砖都不会剩下吧......呜呜呜......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"好了别说了！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"到底是谁？连着死了这么多人，还不够，现在要把所有人的命都搭上？！","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电中的声音","text":"凶、凶手是道具组的莫伊拉......","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"什么？谁在说话？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":37},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1.5","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我说！地块上发生的三起凶案，凶手就是莫伊拉！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"莫伊拉......天......就是那个不起眼的小札拉克？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"格蕾塔女士亲眼所见！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"要不是有卢西恩先生在，我们的制片人也遇害了！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"......那个混蛋在哪里？我要去找她！","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你自己的命都要保不住了，找一个丧心病狂的杀人犯理论还有什么用！","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"难道她不用付出一点代价吗？如果有不知情的剧组成员又遇害该怎么办！","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你都能想明白的问题，难道我想不到吗？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"为了保命，我已经把无线电对讲机调成广播模式，真相现在应该已经传到所有人的耳朵里了。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"凶手绝不敢轻举妄动。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我得保住自己这条值钱的命......等回到蓝卡坞主城区，我就能用这几天收集到的重磅八卦在汐斯塔买套度假别墅了——","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":61},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":62},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.3","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"不好！地块又往源石风暴的方向偏移了！","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"对了，陆行艇！那些陆行艇能救我们！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"......没了。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的工作人员","text":"你说什么？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我去紧急逃生舱看过了，所有的陆行艇都已经被源石风暴毁坏了......所有的......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"我们已经无路可逃了......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"......让我死在风暴里还不如从地块上跳下去呢......我......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"别说傻话！","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"快走，哪里都比拍摄区安全，先到地下动力层躲一躲！","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":84},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":86},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":87},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":88},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"bgeffect","id":92},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":95},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"2","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"n","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"恐怖片的场景设计确实有很多值得参考的地方......谢谢你，蒂比。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"小意思！","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"大致的呈现效果我需要先回去打个样，等到斯蒂芬导演修改完剧本，我们再慢慢敲定细节。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我答应过您，一定会设计出让“杜邦夫人”留名影史的落幕场景！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"嗯，合作愉快。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"（唉，怎么都这个点了？不知道莫丽有没有找到离开地块的方法——）","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":114},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":115},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"4","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":117},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":118,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"啊——！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"什、什么情况？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"不太对劲。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"等等，米兰妮女士，无线电有声音......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电中的声音","text":"......天灾......（杂音）......中控驾驶室......毁......","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"信号怎么这么差？这个声音好像是阿布纳的摄影助理？他又在乱传什么八卦——","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电中的声音","text":"中控驾驶室......炸毁了......","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电中的声音","text":"地块......正冲向天灾......","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电中的声音","text":"......凶手......都是莫伊拉......","id":136},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比紧握住无线电对讲机，使劲地旋动着音量钮，可是已经没有更多的信息传来了......","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"一定是自己听错了，她想。","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"可是，米兰妮女士为什么要这样忧郁地看着自己？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"n","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不......不可能......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"蒂比......没有人会在这个节骨眼开玩笑......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可......莫丽根本没有作案的时间啊？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"谢莉、迈克尔、玛丽昂遇害的晚上，她都在跟我一起看电影，根本没机会——","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"真的没机会吗？","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比在心中质问自己。","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"每次看电影莫丽都会陪自己整个晚上，寸步不离吗？","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不......","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"因为我们每次都是好几部恐怖片一起看，所以她偶尔会在换碟的时候，稍微离开一会儿......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有时候是说格蕾塔女士有事找她，有时候说要去拍摄现场拿落下的东西......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士，你知道的，她刚当上道具组长，压力很大，对自己的工作很上心很上心......","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"孩子......","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不对不对，这最多只能说她具备犯案的条件，并不能直接证明她就是凶手啊......","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"动机呢？她为什么要杀这些与她毫不相关的人？我为什么什么都不知道？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"孩子，或许，你只是没那么了解自己的朋友......","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_62_i12.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","y":"0","id":181},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-100","duration":"20","block":"false","id":182},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"让我们把注意力放在电影身上......莫丽，你别老是分神！","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"抱歉，剧组最近发生的事情太多了，我......我有点紧张......","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有我在你身边啊！","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不管我是什么身份，在这个剧组里，我都是你最好最好的朋友！","id":190},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"image","id":196},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":198},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":199},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"0.5","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"又或许，莫丽她，从来都没把我当成是，朋友......","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"她只是想，利用我......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"黎博利女孩把头垂得很低。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"她再也说不出一句话。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"米兰妮抱住了眼前小小的黎博利。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"几个小时前还在安慰她的女孩，现在靠在自己的肩头哭泣。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"米兰妮轻抚着女孩的后背，她没有再追问什么，也没有帮对方总结所谓成长的代价，只是抱着她......","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"至于现在，蒂比，跟我离开这里吧。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"建筑内复杂的结构太多，如果地块继续靠近天灾中心，这里会变得很危险。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我们得赶紧去地下避难，尽管地块不转向的话，其实也无济于事......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"地下......","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"越过米兰妮的肩头，蒂比看到了她们刚刚从恐怖片中整理出的资料。","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"“地下”这个关键词在她的脑海中盘旋。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"等等，我明白了！","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"怎么，这么快就恢复情绪了？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不，我是想到改变地块航向的方法了！","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有个剧组曾经为了省掉地块租金，偷偷潜入蓝卡坞另一个地块的地下结构拍摄实景，完成了一部很酷的恐怖片......","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我最近才又看过一遍。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那个地块和我们脚下的这个地块，是蓝卡坞出产的同一批拍摄用地块......","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"也就是说，它们的规格和框架是差不多的。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"如果我没有猜错......动力层的深处应该有一个备用的机械控制室。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......有几成把握？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"说实话......完全没有把握。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"但我必须去做。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有些事情，胡思乱想是得不到答案的。只有等到危机解决之后......","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我才能去找她问清楚。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"（温柔的歌声♪）","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"（清亮的口哨♪）","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"卢西恩先生，你来了？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_rglk1normal1_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/rogue_1/m_bat_rglk1normal1_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":269,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"这是姐姐她最喜欢的歌，拍戏的间隙，她经常望着天空哼着这首歌。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我还以为，你已经清醒。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我确实已经清醒了啊。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#10$2","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"多亏了你，让我看到了被自己视而不见的真相......它们真是，太残忍了啊。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那你现在，是在做什么？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":286},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"轰隆隆的声响自脚下传来，这座蓝卡坞地块正向着天灾加速狂奔，人们都在惊慌避险，不会再有工作人员试图来到道具间......","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"可恰恰在此时，道具师做起了她的本职工作。","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"她在道具间来回穿梭，摆弄着一个又一个道具人偶，为它们穿上衣服，为它们纠正姿势......专注而认真。","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"就在刚刚，我终于想起自己是怎么认识劳拉的了。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"容我猜测......你遇见了一个人。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"是的，一位很温柔的菲林。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"background","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cavewaterdrop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"ca","id":303},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"ca","fadetime":"2","id":304},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_cg_floatingleaves.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","id":305},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"60","xTo":"-60","duration":"20","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"那天天气很差，我在长椅上坐了很久，我的脸上有水，应该是雨滴，或者眼泪......","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"明明是那个负责人疏忽导致了事故，可最后，赔光了钱还被赶出剧组的，是我。","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我在蓝卡坞不认识什么人，这样的事情已经经历了很多。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我是从家乡逃出来的，爸爸妈妈死后，我已经无处可去，只剩下......","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"死。","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"然后那个人在旁边坐了下来，我们全程没有说一句话，他只是温柔地等我平复下来......","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他离开之后，我发现自己的膝盖上多了一盘录像带。","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ca","fadetime":"2","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"image","id":321},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"那个人在我看不见任何光亮的时候，将劳拉带进了我的人生。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"劳拉成为了我的姐姐，她守护着我、鼓励着我，让我一点点重新振作起来......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那个时候，劳拉早已死去。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"劳拉的出身、经历，甚至长相都与你相似，那个人为你带来了身处绝境所必需的动力......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"也为你带来了愤怒、困惑、刻骨的仇恨和复仇的渴望......","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#6$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"毫无疑问，那是另一种绝境。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"卢西恩先生，你的眼神中闪过了一丝哀伤......不对，是怜悯？也不对......","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#10$2","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"更像是一种了然于心，一种感同身受。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"在你的身上，发生过类似的事情吗？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你认识那个人？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"当然。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"他擅长将一段本不存在的喜怒嫁接进你的人生，就像一个恣意妄为的导演，蛮横地在一个他认为乏味的故事里添加......","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"唔，用我新学会的电影术语来说——“飞页”。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"他将你拉出绝境，又引导你踏进另一种绝境，由此来激发所谓戏剧的美。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#8$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......他是我的旧识，我的老师，我所有痛苦的根源，一个本应早已死去的幽灵。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"找到你，找到他......","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我为此而来。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"莫伊拉，很遗憾否定了你的一切。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#10$2","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#7$2","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"不。不是这样的，卢西恩先生。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","id":364},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉摆正了最后一个人偶，回到了道具间的正中央。","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"她向着卢西恩施了一个礼，轻轻扣了扣指尖。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩在一瞬间觉察到了异样，抬眼看去，所有的人偶都“活”了过来——","id":368},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"background","id":374},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_62_i05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","y":"0","id":375},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-100","duration":"20","block":"false","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我不认为你否定了我什么。","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"在我人生最为绝望的时候，劳拉出现在了我的身边，她陪伴我度过漫长时光......","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"劳拉就是我的姐姐，我就是劳拉的妹妹。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我不后悔为她报仇，我不后悔背负这些罪孽。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"而且，我会成为这片大地上最后一个记得她的人。","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我哭、我笑、我愤怒、我疑惑、我憎恨、我悲哀、我怀念......","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我因此拥有了，我本无法拥有的一切强烈体会——","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我活着。","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_puppetmove_horror","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"pu","id":389},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"pu","fadetime":"2","id":390},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_62_i05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"2","id":391},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"人偶们移动了起来。","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩认出了人偶的原型......那是死去的道尔顿、谢莉、迈克尔和玛丽昂，以及，她自己。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉伸出手臂，与经过自己身边的人偶逐一相挽，错身。","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"没有音乐配合，地面也在晃动，但小小的札拉克道具师此刻仿若成为了世间最忘情的舞者，她与万千个人相拥......","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"诡异而优雅。","id":398},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"pu","fadetime":"2","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"其实我应该感谢你，卢西恩先生，你让我意识到......","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"“莫伊拉”已经什么都不剩下的时候......","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我觉得自己变成了一面镜子，我可以是——","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"任何人！","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"清醒。","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"因绝望而生的满足，只是毒药。","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我的人生再也没有哪一刻比现在更清醒了，卢西恩先生。","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你也要，成为我的舞伴吗？","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......像它们一样。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉话音落下的瞬间，她的舞伴们扑向了卢西恩——","id":409},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"pu","fadetime":"2","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_puppetrun_horror","volume":"1","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":413},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"90","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":414},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"2.6","block":"false","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"2.6","id":416},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"2.5","yScaleTo":"2.5","duration":"0.2","block":"false","id":417},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"0.2","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":421},{"type":"charslot","id":422},{"type":"background","id":423},{"type":"image","id":424}],"characters":["愤怒的工作人员","害怕的工作人员","无线电中的声音","摄影助理","米兰妮","蒂比","莫伊拉","卢西恩"]}